# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale pt
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [00:00, 06:00).
# Sources: Dicionario Priberam da Lingua Portuguesa
# (https://dicionario.priberam.org/manha), which gives manha as the
# "periodo de tempo entre o amanhecer e o meio-dia". The entry marks no
# European/Brazilian split for these words, and none is made here: both
# varieties say manha, tarde, noite and madrugada alike.
madrugada
